    Copyright (c) 2026 Gavin Nicholls. All rights reserved.

They are not licensed under the MIT License. You may play the game with this software and share unmodified
copies of the software and its card data for playing it. Any other use of the game content, such as
publishing or selling the game, its cards or a derived game, needs the written permission of Gavin Nicholls.

The card data files (data\cards.json and the other files in data\) carry this game content. They are
included so the software can be played, under the terms of this Part.

